---
description: Run quality scripts instead of eyeballing style.
alwaysApply: true
---

After changing Go, JS, HTML, or CSS, run `./scripts/check` from the repo root and fix what it reports. Do not substitute reading the code for those checks. Run `./scripts/fmt` to apply formatters. Run `./scripts/docs` when tests are added or renamed.

- JS/HTML/CSS: prettier + xo (bun, not npm)
- Go: gofumpt + golangci-lint + `go test` + coverage floor
- Living docs: `docs/features.md` and `docs/seams.md` are generated from tests
- Mutation testing is `./scripts/mutate`, not part of `./scripts/check`
